WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:05.672
UGH, MAN I REALLY HAD TO GET OUT
OF THE HOUSE.

00:00:05.706 --> 00:00:07.941
- I WAS GLAD YOU CAME OUT.
- I APPRECIATE IT FOR REAL.

00:00:07.975 --> 00:00:09.643
- LOOK HERE,
YOU CHECK THIS GIRL OUT, MAN.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:13.380
SHE IS FINE.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.316
- SHE AIGHT.
- REALLY?

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.684
- HEY, MAN, I AM GOING TO GO
TO THE BATHROOM.

00:00:17.718 --> 00:00:21.989
- OKAY, MAN.
SEE YOU IN A BIT.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.824
- YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.425
I TOLD MYSELF THIS MORNING
I WASN'T GONNA FALL IN LOVE.

00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:29.863
YOU WENT AND MADE ME BREAK
MY ONLY RULE.

00:00:29.897 --> 00:00:31.598
I'M GONNA TAKE THAT
RIGHT QUICK--

00:00:31.632 --> 00:00:34.768
I AM GOING TO TAKE THAT.
I'M GOING TO USE THAT.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.637
OKAY.
[chuckles]

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.540
- OH, HEY, WHAT'S UP, MAN?
YOU JUST GOT HER NUMBER, HUH?

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:41.975
- YEAH, CHEYENNE.
- OH, IS THAT HER NAME?

00:00:42.009 --> 00:00:43.443
- YEAH, SHE WAS FLY-Y.

00:00:43.477 --> 00:00:45.946
- THAT'S THE GIRL
I WAS TALKING ABOUT.

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.382
- OH, SNAP. ARE YOU SERIOUS?
- YEAH, DUDE.

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:49.783
- OH, I'M SORRY.
- IT AIN'T NO THING, MAN.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.451
FORGET IT.
THERE'S PLENTY OF HOTTIES HERE.

00:00:51.485 --> 00:00:52.419
- I JUST THOUGHT YOU
WERE TALKING ABOUT SOMEONE ELSE.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:54.855
- CHECK HER OUT.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:58.759
[mouths words]

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.327
- I'M NOT A SPORTS MAN,
BUT...

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.629
THINK ME AND YOU
COULD TOUCH DOWN LATER,

00:01:02.663 --> 00:01:04.331
IF YOU KNOW
WHAT I'M SAYING.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.800
[chuckles] AM I BEING STUPID?
BUT FOR REAL THOUGH.

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:09.303
JUST GIVE ME YOUR NUMBER,
WHATEVER.

00:01:09.336 --> 00:01:11.538
THANK YOU, GIRL.
I'MA TAKE THAT FROM YOU.

00:01:11.572 --> 00:01:13.640
- HOW DID YOU GET
OVER HERE SO FAST?

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:15.642
- HUH?

00:01:15.676 --> 00:01:20.314
- NOTHING.
IT JUST SEEMED LIKE YOU--

00:01:20.347 --> 00:01:26.086
- OH, DAMN.
THAT REPORTER IS SMOKIN' HOT.

00:01:28.155 --> 00:01:30.824
WHAT THE [bleep]?

00:01:30.858 --> 00:01:33.694
[ominous music]

00:01:33.727 --> 00:01:37.865
♪

00:01:37.898 --> 00:01:40.467
NO.

00:01:40.501 --> 00:01:41.602
NO!

00:01:41.635 --> 00:01:45.272
NO!

00:01:48.976 --> 00:01:52.713
[chuckles madly]

00:01:52.746 --> 00:01:54.948
HUH?
YEAH.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.789
NO.
NO!

00:02:02.823 --> 00:02:05.425
- HEY, BABY.
- HOW ARE YOU--

00:02:05.459 --> 00:02:07.494
ARE YOU DOING THAT?
- HONEY, WHAT'S WRONG?

00:02:07.528 --> 00:02:09.730
- OH, BABY, I LOVE YOU.

00:02:09.763 --> 00:02:11.098
I'M SORRY.

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.933
I WAS OUT, I WAS LOOKING
AT OTHER WOMEN TONIGHT.

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.968
BUT YOU ARE ALL THERE IS.

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:19.573
ALL RIGHT,
I LOVE YOU.

